; generated-format instantiation 2026-08-08
|term[referent]
  :status settled
  :subject-field addressing
  :layer framing-vocabulary
  :gloss The thing an act intends to pick out.
  |designation referent
    :status preferred
    :channel prose
  |definition
    :defined-by @def-descriptors
    :anchor reference-act
    :projection paraphrase
    The intended target of a reference act; what the descriptors jointly narrow the world down to.
  |rel :kind targeted-by :to @reference-act
  |not
    Not the fetched content — a fetch returns a description-as-of-now of the referent, never the referent itself (the Fetch Assumption's fourth seam).
